  "stories": {
    "Popular sports": {
      "My name is Hank.": {
        "primary": [
          "Hank"
        ],
        "secondary": [],
        "note": "自我介绍的新信息落在名字 Hank 上。"
      },
      "Football in my country is not a sport so much as a form of identity, and the word following does not really describe it.": {
        "primary": [
          "identity",
          "following"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "sport"
        ],
        "note": "第一分句对比：与其说是运动，不如说是身份认同；第二分句的焦点是所讨论的词 following 本身。"
      },
      "A following can be changed; this cannot.": {
        "primary": [
          "changed",
          "cannot"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "following"
        ],
        "note": "对比 following 可以改变、而这份认同不能，焦点分别落在 changed 与 cannot。"
      },
      "The tribal aspect is the part I find both beautiful and troubling.": {
        "primary": [
          "beautiful",
          "troubling"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "tribal"
        ],
        "note": "核心是对部落性的双重评价——既美又令人不安。"
      },
      "My son supports our club's rivals, which is a joke at home and genuinely awkward at his school.": {
        "primary": [
          "rivals",
          "awkward"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "joke",
          "home",
          "school"
        ],
        "note": "儿子支持的是本队对手，rivals 是主句焦点；家里当笑话、学校却真尴尬，awkward 是评价落点。"
      },
      "The loyalty is inherited, and it survives every rational argument.": {
        "primary": [
          "inherited",
          "survives"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "loyalty",
          "rational"
        ],
        "note": "忠诚是继承来的，并且扛得住一切理性论证，两个分句各一个核心。"
      },
      "Meanwhile, the professional game has become a commodity: broadcasting rights and sponsorship have turned the biggest clubs into global brands, and the ticket prices at those clubs exclude the very people who created the atmosphere.": {
        "primary": [
          "commodity",
          "brands",
          "exclude"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "broadcasting",
          "sponsorship",
          "global",
          "atmosphere"
        ],
        "note": "三个分句各一个核心：职业比赛成了商品、大俱乐部成了全球品牌、票价把真正营造氛围的人排除在外。"
      },
      "What keeps me interested is everything below the elite level.": {
        "primary": [
          "elite"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "everything",
          "below"
        ],
        "note": "焦点是精英层级以下的一切，elite 是让步对比的锚点。"
      },
      "There is an amateur league in my city with twelve teams, and the standard is poor, and the matches are wonderful.": {
        "primary": [
          "poor",
          "wonderful"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "amateur",
          "twelve"
        ],
        "note": "核心是水准差而比赛精彩的强烈反差，业余与十二支队伍是背景。"
      },
      "When my daughter plays volleyball for her school, nobody is being sold anything.": {
        "primary": [
          "sold"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "nobody",
          "daughter"
        ],
        "note": "重点不在谁在打球，而在这里没有任何人被推销，sold 是焦点。"
      },
      "Participation is the part of sport that no sponsorship can capture, and if I had to choose between the two, I would keep the twelve amateur teams and lose the broadcast entirely.": {
        "primary": [
          "Participation",
          "keep",
          "lose"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "capture",
          "amateur",
          "broadcast"
        ],
        "note": "主旨是参与感无法被赞助买走；取舍上宁可保留业余队、放弃转播。"
      },
      "Why does Hank say the word following is not adequate?": {
