    "Team sports vs Individual sports": {
      "My name is Iris.": {
        "primary": [
          "Iris"
        ],
        "secondary": [],
        "note": "自我介绍的新信息落在名字 Iris 上。"
      },
      "I played volleyball for ten years before I became a runner, and I now think the two sports develop opposite characters, and both are necessary.": {
        "primary": [
          "opposite",
          "necessary"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "volleyball",
          "runner"
        ],
        "note": "核心是两种运动塑造相反的性格，而两者都必要；排球与跑步是经历背景。"
      },
      "A team sport teaches interdependence.": {
        "primary": [
          "interdependence"
        ],
        "secondary": [],
        "note": "团队运动教会的是相互依赖，interdependence 是信息焦点。"
      },
      "Your performance is inseparable from eight other people's, so accountability is shared and blame is difficult to allocate, which is why a losing team so often destroys itself from within.": {
        "primary": [
          "inseparable",
          "blame",
          "within"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "shared",
          "accountability"
        ],
        "note": "个人表现与他人不可分，责任共享所以难以归咎，输球队伍往往从内部瓦解。"
      },
      "The tactical side also belongs to the coach, and the player's psychology is a matter of adapting to somebody else's decisions.": {
        "primary": [
          "coach",
          "else's"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "tactical",
          "psychology",
          "decisions"
        ],
        "note": "战术归教练，心理上要适应别人的决定，else's 点出‘不是自己的’这一对比。"
      },
      "That is valuable training for any career, and it can also encourage people to hide inside a collective.": {
        "primary": [
          "valuable",
          "hide"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "career",
          "collective"
        ],
        "note": "先肯定对职业有价值，转折落点是可能让人躲在集体里。"
      },
      "Running is the reverse.": {
        "primary": [
          "reverse"
        ],
        "secondary": [],
        "note": "一句话点明跑步正相反，reverse 是焦点。"
      },
      "There is no coach on the road, no teammate to cover the last five kilometres, and only one person to blame.": {
        "primary": [
          "blame"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "coach",
          "teammate"
        ],
        "rise": [
          "coach",
          "teammate"
        ],
        "fall": [
          "blame"
        ],
        "note": "三项都没有：没有教练、没有队友、只能怪自己；前两项升调，末项 blame 降调。"
      },
      "The autonomy is terrifying and clarifying at the same time, because there is nowhere to attribute the result.": {
        "primary": [
          "terrifying",
          "clarifying",
          "nowhere"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "autonomy",
          "result"
        ],
        "note": "自主既可怕又让人清醒，关键是无处推卸结果。"
      },
      "I now play volleyball in the summer and I am far more competitive than I ever was alone.": {
        "primary": [
          "competitive"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "volleyball",
          "alone",
          "more"
        ],
        "note": "重点是对比独跑时，现在打球让她竞争性强得多。"
      },
      "If a young person asked me, I would say: do a team sport first, because it will teach you how to be reliable, and then find out who you are when nobody is watching.": {
        "primary": [
