      },
      "The symbolic value is genuine.": {
        "primary": [
          "genuine"
        ],
        "secondary": [],
        "note": "肯定象征意义是真的，genuine 是评价焦点。"
      },
      "For two weeks, athletes from two hundred countries compete under identical rules, and a swimmer from a country with three medals can beat one from a country with three hundred.": {
        "primary": [
          "identical",
          "beat"
        ],
        "secondary": [
