        "note": "核心是规则对所有人一致，小国选手也能击败大国选手，identical 与 beat 是焦点。"
      },
      "Qualification, however, is uneven: it is far easier to qualify from some continents than others, and the amateurism of the movement has been replaced by professional commercialisation, which brings sponsorship and pressure in equal measure.": {
        "primary": [
          "uneven",
          "commercialisation",
          "equal"
        ],
        "secondary": [
          "easier",
          "others",
          "sponsorship",
          "pressure"
        ],
        "note": "资格不均、业余精神被职业商业化取代，且赞助与压力并至，equal 收束。"
      },
      "The real problem is the expense.": {
